            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. All GSTAT appeals must be filed electronically at efiling.gstat.gov.in. The GSTAT is fully digital from inception. Register on the portal, validate your ARN/CRN, complete Form APL-05, upload PDF documents, pay fees via BharatKosh, and digitally sign."
          }
