          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the pre-deposit for filing at the Pune GSTAT bench?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The mandatory pre-deposit under S.112(8) is 20% of disputed tax, inclusive of 10% at first appeal stage. Cap: Rs 50 Crore each CGST/SGST. Payment through Electronic Cash Ledger triggers automatic stay of recovery. The 53rd GST Council recommended reducing to 10% (not yet effective)."
