<div class="step-card" style="direction:rtl"><div class="step-content" style="direction:ltr"><span class="step-badge">Step 4</span><h3 class="step-title">File on GSTAT e-Filing Portal</h3><p class="step-description">Submit <strong>Form APL-05</strong> at <a href="https://efiling.gstat.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">efiling.gstat.gov.in</a> with pre-deposit proof within <strong>3 months under S.112(1)</strong>. For backlog appeals (orders before 1 April 2026): deadline <strong>30 June 2026</strong>. Pay fees via BharatKosh. Portal validates ARN/CRN from original APL-01/APL-03.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>E-filing with BharatKosh</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>ARN/CRN validated</span></div></div><div class="step-visual" style="direction:ltr"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none"><rect x="15" y="15" width="90" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="25" y="25" width="70" height="6" rx="2" fill="#F5A623" opacity="0.4"/><path d="M55 58 l5 5 10-10" stroke="#10B981" stroke-width="2"/></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">E-Filed</span><span class="step-number-large">04</span></div></div></div>
